  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 mins. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add milk (for the mash) and 1/2 the butter and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a4e7dca619a9a7b40d9ece/step-b0cd20c8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop brown onion. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot and onion until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add beans and garlic seasoning and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• In a medium bowl, whisk together cheese sauce mix, the water and milk (for the sauce).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a4e7dca619a9a7b40d9ece/step-7e72833e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Stir cheese sauce mix and remaining butter into bean mixture and simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Season to taste.\n• Transfer bean filling to a baking dish and spread potato mash over the top.\n• Sprinkle with crumbled Parmesan cheese. Grill until golden, 5-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a4e7dca619a9a7b40d9ece/step-44574398.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut tomato into wedges. In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide creamy red kidney bean pie between plates. Serve with tomato salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a4e7dca619a9a7b40d9ece/step-202fc5cd.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
